<title>JAPAN: Tobishima shares surge.</title>
<headline>Tobishima shares surge.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tobishima Corp surged in Wednesday's morning session as participants bought back, brokers said. They said that dealers and other short-term players were also buying the issue.</p>
<p>As of 0148 GMT, the shares were up 7 yen at 223 yen.</p>
